{"id":"msg_m_nikke_pepper_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_orangeperfect","label":"Citrus Splendamin · Chat"},"label":"1. Old-timer.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_nikke_pepper_05","speakers":{"orangeperfect":"Citrus Splendamin"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_1","text":"Old-timer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_2","text":"You are Pepper's boyfriend?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_3","text":"Who are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_4","text":"We met yesterday.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_5","text":"You and Pepper came to me and said you two are dating.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_6","text":"Ah, that kid?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_7","text":"Yes, it's me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_8","text":"How did you get my contact info?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_9","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_10","text":"I asked Dr. Mary, and she told me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_11","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_12","text":"Come to the point, Old-timer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_13","text":"What do you like about Pepper?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_14","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_14","text":"She's pretty.","jump":"m_nikke_pepper_02_16"},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_15","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_15","text":"She has a good personality.","jump":"m_nikke_pepper_02_17"},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_16","text":"What? Do you mean her personality is not good enough?","jump":"m_nikke_pepper_02_18"},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_17","text":"What? Do you mean she's not pretty enough?","jump":"m_nikke_pepper_02_18"},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_18","text":"That's my favorite part.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_19","text":"I know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_20","text":"I'm just teasing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_21","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_22","text":"Aren't you angry?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_23","text":"Angry for what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_24","text":"You're pretty good... as an Old-timer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_25","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_26","text":"So, you are a commander, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_27","text":"Those who lead Nikkes to the surface?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_28","text":"That's true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_29","text":"I'm not satisfied with your job at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_30","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_31","text":"You could die like a bug.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_32","text":"I won't.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_33","text":"Forget it. It's the same in Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_34","text":"You're qualified.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_35","text":"You can be my Pepper's boyfriend. I approved.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_36","text":"Thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_37","text":"Be nice to her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_38","text":"Don't make her cry, or I will come for you as a ghost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_39","text":"Why a ghost?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_40","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_41","text":"Because I'm gonna die.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_42","text":"I heard that you were about to have an operation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_43","text":"That won't work.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_44","text":"No one can make it happen... even if it's Pepper.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_45","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_46","text":"I knew everything. Everyone said that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_47","text":"The survival rate of that operation is 5%.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_48","text":"That's enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_49","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_50","text":"It's only 5%!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_51","text":"You still have a 5% chance to survive. How lucky.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_52","text":"What a stubborn guy you are.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_53","text":"But...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_54","text":"That's just like Pepper.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_55","text":"You are a good guy, Old-timer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_56","text":"Why do you like Pepper so much?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_57","text":"What? Why ask that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_58","text":"Looks like she is beloved by every patient in this hospital.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_59","text":"On the one hand, she saves us, and we are grateful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_60","text":"On the other hand, she treats us like family members.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_61","text":"She insists on telling us that we will be alive and regain our health.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_62","text":"Of course, her pure kindness and warm encouragement win our favor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_63","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_63","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_64","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_65","text":"Take good care of our Pepper, please.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_66","text":"Oh, one more thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_67","text":"Don't tell her I talked to you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_pepper_02_68","type":"Narration","speaker":"orangeperfect","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_pepper_02_68","text":"Citrus Splendamin has left the Chatting Room.","jump":null}],"chat":true}